    "result": "Fixed: `Parenthesis._groupable_tokens` in `sqlparse/sql.py:508` was slicing `self.tokens[1:-2]` instead of `self.tokens[1:-1]`, which excluded the last real token before the closing `)` from grouping (e.g. the tail of a `WHERE` clause inside a subquery). Restored the correct slice, and both the WHERE grouping and issue9-style nested parenthesis cases now behave correctly."
  },
